WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.455
Brand Stores are customizable multi-page storefronts, where you can showcase your products and create

00:00:05.455 --> 00:00:08.000
unique shopping experiences in the Amazon Store.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:14.157
This video shows you how to build an effective brand store, from designing your home page to creating

00:00:14.157 --> 00:00:17.300
product-rich sub-pages using available layout tools and tiles.

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:19.700
Let's start by creating your home page.

00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:25.442
Add your brand name and logo, then enable Display All Deals page to automatically show your live

00:00:25.442 --> 00:00:27.900
deals on a page next to the home page.

00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:31.200
It will only appear when you have four or more active deals.

00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.900
Next, choose how your products will appear.

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:39.256
We recommend selecting the standard layout, unless you're working with larger product images like

00:00:39.256 --> 00:00:40.700
fashion or home decor.

00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:45.700
Finally, give your home page a description and pick a template to get started building your store.

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:47.700
Now, craft your home page.

00:00:47.900 --> 00:00:53.683
Start with an eye-catching hero image, the main banner at the top of each page, to showcase your

00:00:53.683 --> 00:00:54.900
brand story and products.

00:00:55.400 --> 00:00:59.400
Add an image with text overlay for your main slogan or value statement.

00:00:59.900 --> 00:01:05.100
Create category tiles linking to product pages, showing your full offering at a glance.

00:01:05.600 --> 00:01:09.600
Use a product grid or collection to highlight new arrivals or seasonal products.

00:01:10.100 --> 00:01:13.800
Consider adding video or shoppable images to help boost engagement.

00:01:14.300 --> 00:01:19.100
Add a section displaying best-selling or recommended products, which updates automatically.

00:01:19.700 --> 00:01:24.944
When adding a new page, select a template and customize it with tiles featuring products, images

00:01:24.944 --> 00:01:25.600
and text.

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:31.900
You can copy existing pages or tiles using the three dots menu and even move tiles between pages.

00:01:32.200 --> 00:01:37.800
For product tiles, select Hide Out of Stock products to automatically remove unavailable items.

00:01:38.200 --> 00:01:41.600
Remember, pages closer to the home page get more visibility.

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:43.800
So prioritize what matters most.

00:01:44.200 --> 00:01:47.300
Mobile users access all pages through the categories button.

00:01:48.300 --> 00:01:52.400
Finally, if you run promotions, use the Automated All Deals page we mentioned.

00:01:53.100 --> 00:01:58.011
Additionally, you can add the Featured Deals widget to your home page or sub pages for increased

00:01:58.011 --> 00:01:58.300
visibility.

00:01:58.800 --> 00:02:03.900
This widget automatically displays your active deals and only appears when you have live deals running.

00:02:04.400 --> 00:02:08.400
Preview your brand store on mobile and desktop, then submit for publishing.

00:02:08.800 --> 00:02:11.800
The moderation process takes up to 72 hours.

00:02:12.300 --> 00:02:17.430
With your brand store set up, you're ready to bring your brand to life and start creating engaging

00:02:17.430 --> 00:02:18.000
shopping experiences.

00:02:18.300 --> 00:02:19.800
Create your store today.
